Package: SampleSurvival
Title: Sample Size Calculation for Survival Analysis Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Victor J.", "Vera-Ponce", email = "victor_jvp@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculates the required sample size for multivariable analysis of associated factors in open cohort studies with time-to-event analysis using the events per variable (EPV) method. The package is designed for studies using Cox regression to estimate hazard ratios (HR).
